{"4606460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Succubi Domini", "steam_appid": 4606460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/ec7c7db9619266dceac3c081f4145661.avif?t=1787185664\" width=858 height=72 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SUCCUBUS-DOMINATING RPG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies <strong>change their weaknesses</strong>. Others <strong>call for allies</strong>. Some even <strong>use the environmen</strong>t to gain the upper hand...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>weapons</strong>, <strong>skills</strong>, and <strong>demonic allies</strong> to adapt to every challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your party with different succubi</strong> to take on villains and tyrants.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit enemy weaknesses</strong> to claim victory.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore hostile environments</strong> while <strong>managing your resources</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip the abilities of recruited succubi onto your protagonist!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/8ec9be9da936d2576f1d405bb8e3d8cd.poster.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1166 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/8ec9be9da936d2576f1d405bb8e3d8cd.webm?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/8ec9be9da936d2576f1d405bb8e3d8cd.mp4?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit succubi during battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no magical items to capture monsters here. You must <strong>talk</strong>, <strong>understand</strong>, and <strong>persuade your enemies</strong> to join you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>information</strong> you gather about each girl to <strong>win them over</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for <strong>opportunistic succubi</strong>!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Receive gifts</strong> from your admirers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade <strong>items</strong>, <strong>mana</strong> and <strong>even your own life</strong> to earn their support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/7bd4271592b8296950602024fb36398c.poster.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1166 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/7bd4271592b8296950602024fb36398c.webm?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/7bd4271592b8296950602024fb36398c.mp4?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>G-Grow closer to them?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relationship with your succubi <strong>grants bonuses in battle</strong>. <strong>Deepen your bond to unlock unique abilities</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your bond level through <strong>dialogue</strong> and <strong>hidden interactions</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each <strong>girl’s quest </strong>and <strong>discover more about their pasts and desires</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infernal Bond</strong>: Your <strong>damage increases</strong> <strong>based on your relationship</strong> with your party!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the <strong>maximum bond level</strong> to gain the <strong>unique ability of your favorite succubus</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/1899105219a91d3bfd17faeb9388f060.poster.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1166 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/1899105219a91d3bfd17faeb9388f060.webm?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/1899105219a91d3bfd17faeb9388f060.mp4?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A touch of chuuni flair!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles</strong>, <strong>magic</strong>, and <strong>scythes</strong>. The more <strong>belts</strong> and <strong>chains</strong>, the better.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> and <strong>shape the fate</strong> of a <strong>stylish world</strong> filled with <strong>thorns</strong> and <strong>chokers</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield and witness <strong>epic spells</strong> and <strong>ancient powers</strong>. A metal album brought to life as a game!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in the rustic village of <strong>Blumenbrücken</strong> — a vintage, decaying haven. <strong>Perfect for mall goths</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby text </strong>included!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/59074a4654be9276c5a0436c07de434d.poster.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1166 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/59074a4654be9276c5a0436c07de434d.webm?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/59074a4654be9276c5a0436c07de434d.mp4?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vampig...!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes. <strong>Vampire pigs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edgy, huh?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/5331ba90c9e959ace60eda58c6fbfc93.poster.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1166 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/5331ba90c9e959ace60eda58c6fbfc93.webm?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/5331ba90c9e959ace60eda58c6fbfc93.mp4?t=1787185664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/b7120f616ac0abb9ac63954895f67927.avif?t=1787185664\" width=858 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fall of the Old Empire, the world has descended into constant war and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this RPG, you take on the role of <strong>Arius</strong> — a young man stripped of his dreams and forced to serve in the army of Ravensburg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/4861b504b59f2edd3516edbea6255b50.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1167 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But… what if something were to change his life forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ufufu...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/a0c7e716da01a96c88195bdd3406e2de.avif?t=1787185664\" width=1167 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how Arius became a <strong>Succubus Dominator</strong>—facing his fears, and perhaps creating even bigger problems along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/7060f77ed004ac7c776a24823075b8cc.avif?t=1787185664\" width=858 height=72 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras/ae4c6b3fd64c36a6a7af8a6a79d9b735.avif?t=1787185664\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606460/extras_big/ae4c6b3fd64c36a6a7af8a6a79d9b735.avif?t=1787185664 width=1560 height=980 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb